cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SlotMIL"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered evaluation of instance-level localisation metrics for
  weakly-supervised multiple-instance learning in volumetric CT. Reports the
  extent to which such metrics are dominated by an anatomical position prior,
  decomposes that prior into its axial and in-plane parts, and proposes a
  prior-normalised skill estimand validated against a supervised patch ceiling.
  Every claim is gated on a hypothesis frozen before the confirmatory runs;
  the analysis plan and its amendment chain ship with the code.
